      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>This scenario looks like a lot of fun, but I had a few questions about spawning:</p><p>a) How many humans do you spawn at the beginning of the game?</p><p>b) How many humans do you spawn at the end of each round?</p><p>c) Do you spawn all four raptors to start the game?</p><p>d) Can dinosaurs respawn after being killed? If they can, how does that work (i.e. do all dead dinosaurs spawn at the beginning of their turn)?</p><p>And finally, though not spawn related,</p><p>e) &quot;Thugs will move towards the closest non-Thug target with the lowest Health that they can see.&quot; Are they prioritizing low health or distance? That is, if a thug can see a 4 health target 2 hexes away and a 1 health target 6 hexes away, which one will he move toward?</p><p>I&#39;m looking forward to trying this out!</p>",
