    {
      "id": 135331,
      "name": "SALLstice",
      "username": "SALLstice",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/848f3c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-05T20:19:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"metlarcturus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/metlarcturus/48/2210_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> metlarcturus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>a) How many humans do you spawn at the beginning of the game?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>All of them</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"metlarcturus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/metlarcturus/48/2210_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> metlarcturus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>b) How many humans do you spawn at the end of each round?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>All of them</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"metlarcturus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/metlarcturus/48/2210_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> metlarcturus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>c) Do you spawn all four raptors to start the game?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>All of them</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"metlarcturus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/metlarcturus/48/2210_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> metlarcturus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>d) Can dinosaurs respawn after being killed? If they can, how does that work (i.e. do all dead dinosaurs spawn at the beginning of their turn)?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>All o… er, I mean, yeah, Dinosaurs spawn at the start of their turn then they move on that same turn. &nbsp;It's stated in there, but certainly could be made more clear. &nbsp;I have a habit of writing rules so they make sense to me, and polishing them up after a week or so of feedback. &nbsp;So expect that soon.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"metlarcturus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/metlarcturus/48/2210_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> metlarcturus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>e) \"Thugs will move towards the closest non-Thug target with the lowest Health that they can see.\" Are they prioritizing low health or distance? That is, if a thug can see a 4 health target 2 hexes away and a 1 health target 6 hexes away, which one will he move toward?I'm looking forward to trying this out!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&lt;strike&gt;First distance, then Health. &nbsp;Also will make this more clear.&lt;/strike&gt;<br>EDIT: This is not true anymore <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Thanks for the questions! More feedback is always good.</p>\n<p>EDIT: I'm also working on a way to scale with number of Heroes, so you probably won't always spawn all the raptors and humans every time, but for now it seems to work well enough.</p>",
      "post_number": 14,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:11:23.099Z",
